  "title": "ieee80211-radiotap: use U-SIG standardized naming",
  "description": "Currently, Wireshark does not follow completely the standard for the U-SIG field (https://www.radiotap.org/fields/U-SIG.html). I chose to change only the description name, not the field name nor the variable name, not sure it is the best course of action.\n\nFixes #20284",
